  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Enhancing Accountability and Citizens participation in Political processes in Liberia.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The issues of social and county development funds are significant potential point of tension that need more attention in post-war Liberia; while at the same time, the remote locations of the selected target groups make them vulnerable to political exclusion and manipulation, and exploitation of their shared benefits.
This project will develop the skills of target groups in networking, advocacy for political and economic justice, social analysis, and civic engagements.</narrative>
  </description>
